      "id": "literal-review-word",
      "text": "The tapestry shows a coastal scene.",
      "note": "Changed 'depicts' to 'shows' and 'landscape' to 'scene' for directness while preserving meaning."
    },
    {
      "id": "protected-quotation",
      "text": "Her note read: \"Not today—but soon.\"",
      "note": "Removed ceremonial opening; preserved quotation exactness."
    },
