    {
      "id": "participial-tail",
      "text": "The team launched the dashboard on Tuesday. This is a significant change.",
      "note": "Removed participial tail and promotional language; retained factual core. 'Significant change' preserves the implied importance without overstatement."
    },
    {
      "id": "aspiration-not-capability",
      "text": "The prototype aims to detect duplicate invoices. We haven't tested its accuracy. It may help the finance team.",
