    {
      "id": "mathematical-representation",
      "text": "The vector represents velocity. Robust regression estimates the slope while reducing outlier influence.",
      "note": "Simplified 'limiting the effect of' to 'reducing' for conciseness; preserved mathematical meaning."
    },
    {
      "id": "plain-punctuation",
      "text": "The migration is complete. The manager said, \"Ready to launch.\" We still need to check the backups.",
      "note": "Applied plain punctuation: removed dash and emoji, used straight quotes."
    },
    {
      "id": "business-paragraph",
      "text": "On Tuesday, I helped deploy the cache to two servers. Median latency for repeated requests fell from 80 ms to 60 ms in our 30-minute test. We haven't tested cold starts or the other eight servers. The dashboard still shows yesterday's data.",
